CVPR-2025-P0217,CVPR-2025-A001394,Shuailei Ma,shared,3,10,10,"College of Information Science and Engineering, Northeastern University, Shenyang , China Ant Group Shanghai Jiao Tong University Alibaba Group HKUST (a) Text-to-Image Generation (b) Novel View Synthesis (c) Image-to-Video Generation Figure . Diverse downstream tasks of Lumos including (a) text-to-image generation, (b) novel view synthesis (left: input view, middle: random novel views, right: reconstruction Gaussian) and (c) image-to-video generation. study image-to-image (I2I) generation, where models can learn from in-the-wild images in a self-supervised manner. We first develop a pure vision-based training framework, Lumos, and confirm the feasibility and the scalability of learning I2I models. We then find that, as an upstream task of T2I, our I2I model serves as a more foundational visual prior and achieves on-par or better performance than existing T2I models using only / text-image pairs for fine-tuning. We further demonstrate the superiority of I2I priors over T2I priors on some text-irrelevant visual generative tasks, like image-to-3D and image-to-video.",-5,data/raw/cvpr/2025/first_pages/CVPR-2025-P0217.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/papers/Ma_Learning_Visual_Generative_Priors_without_Text_CVPR_2025_paper.pdf
