CVPR-2025-P0401,CVPR-2025-A002520,Xin Yan,shared,3,6,6,"A young boy rides a bicycle down the long corridors of a towering ancient castle. The camera follows closely as he moves. As he exits the castle, the scene opens up to reveal a lush, vibrant garden filled with greenery and flowers, sunlight pouring over the landscape. An extreme close-up shot of an ant emerging from its nest. The camera pulls back revealing a neighborhood beyond the hill. Figure . Presto can generate long videos with rich content and long-range coherence.",-6,data/raw/cvpr/2025/first_pages/CVPR-2025-P0401.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/papers/Yan_Long_Video_Diffusion_Generation_with_Segmented_Cross-Attention_and_Content-Rich_Video_CVPR_2025_paper.pdf
