CVPR-2025-P0486,CVPR-2025-A003052,Tongyuan Bai,shared,3,6,6,"School of Artificial Intelligence, Jilin University School of Software, Shandong University Engineering Research Center of Knowledge-Driven Human-Machine Intelligence, MOE, China User Inputs Diagram chair cabinet chair Text Room Image Add a tv_stand behind the table Text Make the room in white style Sketch Text Replace the right nightstand with a wardrobe table chair Synthesized 3D Indoor Scene chair Figure . We introduce FreeScene, a user-friendly controllable indoor scene synthesis framework that allows convenient and effective control with free-form user inputs, including text and/or different types of images (top-view diagram in the left, realistic photograph in the middle, sketch in the right). Leveraging a multimodal agent ( ) to extract partial graph priors ( ) from user inputs, FreeScene subsequently generates a complete and reasonable scene that conforms to the graph via a generative diffusion model ( ).",3,data/raw/cvpr/2025/first_pages/CVPR-2025-P0486.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/papers/Bai_FreeScene_Mixed_Graph_Diffusion_for_3D_Scene_Synthesis_from_Free_CVPR_2025_paper.pdf
