CVPR-2025-P0576,CVPR-2025-A003608,Haolin Liu,shared,3,6,6,"FNii, CUHKSZ equal contribution Tencent corresponding author Tencent-Hunyuan3D SSE, CUHKSZ haolinliu97.github.io/Stable-Score Figure . We propose Stable-SCore: A Stable Registration-based Framework for 3D Shape Correspondence. Given a source and a target mesh, our approach registers the source mesh to the target and establishes dense correspondence between them, with strong robustness to large variations in mesh topology, shape, and pose, as shown in (a). Our method enables a range of downstream applications, including re-topology, texture transfer, rig transfer, and shape interpolation, as shown in (b).",-16,data/raw/cvpr/2025/first_pages/CVPR-2025-P0576.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/papers/Liu_Stable-SCore_A_Stable_Registration-based_Framework_for_3D_Shape_Correspondence_CVPR_2025_paper.pdf
