CVPR-2025-P0713,CVPR-2025-A004479,Jiteng Mu,shared,3,3,3,"UC San Diego, NVIDIA Change the horse to golden. Change the cat to tiger. Segmentation-to-Image Remove the bee over the flowers. Change sky to sunset. Edge-to-Image Add flowers to woman’s hair. Change to Cartoon. Depth-to-Image Figure . We propose EditAR, a unified conditional autoregressive model for diverse conditional generation tasks. We demonstrate that without task-specific designs, a single autoregressive model achieves strong performance across diverse tasks, including texture manipulation, object replacement, object removal, local editing, canny-to-image, depth-to-image, and segmentation-to-image.",-2,data/raw/cvpr/2025/first_pages/CVPR-2025-P0713.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/papers/Mu_EditAR_Unified_Conditional_Generation_with_Autoregressive_Models_CVPR_2025_paper.pdf
CVPR-2025-P0713,CVPR-2025-A004480,Nuno Vasconcelos,shared,3,3,3,"UC San Diego, NVIDIA Change the horse to golden. Change the cat to tiger. Segmentation-to-Image Remove the bee over the flowers. Change sky to sunset. Edge-to-Image Add flowers to woman’s hair. Change to Cartoon. Depth-to-Image Figure . We propose EditAR, a unified conditional autoregressive model for diverse conditional generation tasks. We demonstrate that without task-specific designs, a single autoregressive model achieves strong performance across diverse tasks, including texture manipulation, object replacement, object removal, local editing, canny-to-image, depth-to-image, and segmentation-to-image.",-2,data/raw/cvpr/2025/first_pages/CVPR-2025-P0713.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/papers/Mu_EditAR_Unified_Conditional_Generation_with_Autoregressive_Models_CVPR_2025_paper.pdf
