CVPR-2025-P0836,CVPR-2025-A005224,Rong Wang,shared,3,13,13,"Australian National University Meta Reality Labs Research Figure . FRESA. We present a novel method to reconstruct personalized skinned avatars with realistic pose-dependent animation all in a feed-forward approach, which generalizes to causally taken phone photos without any fine-tuning. We visualize the predicted skinning weights associated with the most important joints in (b) and colormaps of per-vertex displacement magnitudes1 during animation in (c).",2,data/raw/cvpr/2025/first_pages/CVPR-2025-P0836.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/papers/Wang_FRESA_Feedforward_Reconstruction_of_Personalized_Skinned_Avatars_from_Few_Images_CVPR_2025_paper.pdf
