CVPR-2025-P0884,CVPR-2025-A005536,Jamie Wynn,shared,3,5,5,"Niantic UCL Figure . We introduce a new method for stylization of novel views using text prompts. The output of our method is a stylized 3D Gaussian Splatting model of which we show renders here. Our method allows stylization control of both appearance and shape. Using the same prompt, our method can produce different stylizations with variable shape alteration, allowing for more striking shape and color stylization compared to GaussCtrl [",-6,data/raw/cvpr/2025/first_pages/CVPR-2025-P0884.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/papers/Wynn_Morpheus_Text-Driven_3D_Gaussian_Splat_Shape_and_Color_Stylization_CVPR_2025_paper.pdf
