CVPR-2025-P1344,CVPR-2025-A008444,Youxin Pang,shared,3,8,8,"Tsinghua University Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications Beijing Normal University Figure . ManiVideo: We propose a novel framework for generalizable and dexterous hand-object manipulation video generation. Left: Given several reference images of unseen objects, our method generates realistic and plausible manipulation videos driven by hand-object signals. By integrating multiple datasets, ManiVideo supports applications such as human-centered manipulation video generation. Driving signals are shown in the corner. Right: To ensure hand-object consistency, we introduce a multi-layer occlusion representation capable of learning 3D occlusion relationships from occlusion-free normal maps and occlusion confidence maps.",-7,data/raw/cvpr/2025/first_pages/CVPR-2025-P1344.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/papers/Pang_ManiVideo_Generating_Hand-Object_Manipulation_Video_with_Dexterous_and_Generalizable_Grasping_CVPR_2025_paper.pdf
CVPR-2025-P1344,CVPR-2025-A008445,Ruizhi Shao,shared,3,8,8,"Tsinghua University Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications Beijing Normal University Figure . ManiVideo: We propose a novel framework for generalizable and dexterous hand-object manipulation video generation. Left: Given several reference images of unseen objects, our method generates realistic and plausible manipulation videos driven by hand-object signals. By integrating multiple datasets, ManiVideo supports applications such as human-centered manipulation video generation. Driving signals are shown in the corner. Right: To ensure hand-object consistency, we introduce a multi-layer occlusion representation capable of learning 3D occlusion relationships from occlusion-free normal maps and occlusion confidence maps.",-7,data/raw/cvpr/2025/first_pages/CVPR-2025-P1344.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/papers/Pang_ManiVideo_Generating_Hand-Object_Manipulation_Video_with_Dexterous_and_Generalizable_Grasping_CVPR_2025_paper.pdf
