CVPR-2025-P1398,CVPR-2025-A008762,Peter Sushko,shared,3,9,9,"ψ University of Washington Change his racing suit to red Colorize this photo Make her hair pink Make her clothes black and pink Replace the background with blank space Make his hair messy Give him Joker’s makeup Allen Institute for AI Give Simba a crown Fix his tooth Give him a Christmas hat Remove his tattoo Figure . We visualize edits made by our model. We introduce R EAL E DIT, a large-scale image editing dataset sourced from Reddit with real-world user edit requests and human-edits. By finetuning on R EAL E DIT, our resultant model outperforms existing models by up to Elo points with human judgment and delivers real world utility to real user requests online.",-2,data/raw/cvpr/2025/first_pages/CVPR-2025-P1398.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/papers/Sushko_RealEdit_Reddit_Edits_As_a_Large-scale_Empirical_Dataset_for_Image_CVPR_2025_paper.pdf
