CVPR-2025-P1738,CVPR-2025-A010829,Shaoteng Liu,shared,3,11,11,"The Chinese University of Hong Kong Adobe Research The Hong Kong University of Science and Technology SmartMore (e) Multiple Edits (d) Object & Effect Tracking (c) Object Insertion (b) Background Replacement (a) Object & Effect Removal Original Frame # Input Video Frames (top) / Propagated by Ours (bottom) Edited Frame # Figure . GenProp. We propose a generative video propagation framework (GenProp), which can seamlessly propagate any first frame edit through the video. GenProp supports a wide range of video applications, including (a) complete object removal with effects such as shadows and reflections, (b) background replacement with realistic effects, (c) object insertion where inserted objects have physically plausible motion (i.e., blueberries falling while spoon goes up), (d) tracking of objects and their associated effects, and (e) multiple edits (outpainting, insertion, removal) at a single inference run.",-17,data/raw/cvpr/2025/first_pages/CVPR-2025-P1738.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/papers/Liu_Generative_Video_Propagation_CVPR_2025_paper.pdf
