CVPR-2025-P1783,CVPR-2025-A011082,Chris Rockwell,shared,3,6,6,"New York University3 Figure . We introduce DynPose-100K, a large-scale video dataset of dynamic content with camera annotations. DynPose-100K consists of , Internet videos that span diverse settings. We curate DynPose-100K such that videos contain dynamic content while ensuring the cameras are able to be estimated (including intrinsics and poses). Towards this end, we address two challenging problems: (a) identifying the videos suitable for camera estimation, and (b) improving the camera estimation algorithm for dynamic videos.",-2,data/raw/cvpr/2025/first_pages/CVPR-2025-P1783.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/papers/Rockwell_Dynamic_Camera_Poses_and_Where_to_Find_Them_CVPR_2025_paper.pdf
