CVPR-2025-P1978,CVPR-2025-A012347,Feng-Lin Liu,shared,3,7,7,"Beijing Key Laboratory of Mobile Computing and Pervasive Device, Institute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences University of Chinese Academy of Sciences Hong Kong University of Science and Technology Kuaishou Technology Figure . Our method enables high-quality video generation (a) and editing (b) based on sketch and text inputs. (a) Top: With the same text prompt, different keyframe sketches lead to results with similar semantics but diverse sketch-faithful geometry. (a) Bottom: With the same sketches, varied text prompts yield diverse appearances. (b) Users can also edit real videos by drawing on keyframe sketches, with edits automatically propagated even when edited objects in original videos have translation and rotation.",1,data/raw/cvpr/2025/first_pages/CVPR-2025-P1978.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2025/papers/Liu_SketchVideo_Sketch-based_Video_Generation_and_Editing_CVPR_2025_paper.pdf
